<title>UK: IKB sets 200 million mark Dec 2000 FRN.</title>
<headline>IKB sets 200 million mark Dec 2000 FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following domestic floating-rate issue was announced by joint lead managers BHF-Bank and IKB.</p>
<p> BORROWER   IKB DEUTSCHE INDUSTRIEBANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    200 MLN DEM   SPREAD     FLAT	MATURITY    19.DEC.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 BASE	 3M LIBOR  PAY DATE    19.SEP.96</p>
<p> LAST MOODY =	   ISS PRICE  100.08    FULL FEES   20 BP</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   =	   REOFFER    =</p>
<p> LISTING    DUES	DENOMS (K) ONE	 SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    10 BP     SELL CONC  10 BP     PRAECIP     =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
